$$
 \begin{aligned} I &= \lim_{x\to0}\frac{\sin6x-6x}{x^{3}}+\lim_{x\to0}\frac{6x+xf(x)}{x^{3}} \\ &=\lim_{x\to0}\frac{-\frac{1}{6}(6x)^{3}}{x^{3}}+\lim_{x\to0}\frac{6+f(x)}{x^{2}} \\ &=-36+ \Box=0 \Rightarrow \Box=36 \end{aligned} 
